    {
      "@id": "https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-explorer/id/index",
      "@type": "okf:Concept",
      "description": "An **Open Knowledge Format (OKF v0.2)** bundle covering **AI infrastructure** in two complementary threads: the **agent-ready vertical stack** (contracts → discovery → identity → execution → policy → observability/provenance) and the **federated collaborative-learning layer**. It uses standard Markdown concepts and the v0.2 provenance, trust and lifecycle families, with optional Explorer YAML-LD, federation and presentation extensions.",
